L109: push_constant_string "Cannibal jadinko"
L110: pop_string_local 0
L111: push_constant_string "These jadinko prey on other jadinkos. They roam the habitat looking for other creatures to snack on. Unlike other jadinkos, the cannibal jadinko's magic is located not in the vine, but in its teeth. The plant teeth can be used to make a deliciously tasty gumbo, if mixed with the right herbs."
