L152: pop_string_local 0
L153: push_constant_string "The amphibious jadinko is as at home on land as it is in water. These creatures may be slimy and froggish, but their oily vines can be extremely useful. When combined with the appropriate herb, their vines can be used to create potions that attract wood spirits when you are woodcutting, making a lumberjack's life significantly easier."
