L190: pop_string_local 0
L191: push_constant_string "The camouflaged jadinko is a stealthy critter that takes great delight in hiding itself in foliage. The magic of its striped vines is particularly odd and cannot be turned into a potion; however, Papa Mambo has mentioned that he has uses for these vines."
